// Contract kinds (docs/specs/phase6/contracts-and-rumours-v2.md 3): what posts each (need), who pays (issuer), the pay formula, the deadline in game days, how completion is verified (verify) and what
// failing costs (fail). Pay = pay_base + pay_per_unit_x100 x units / 100, the units by pay_unit (km_kg: kilometres x kilograms; guard_day: days x guards; day; head). Money is in mites.
// A need of "hook" is content only until the part that owns the need lands (rule, slavery, heists, faith, diplomacy); the scanner posts the others today. "crime" kinds are posted by fences and band
// leaders and shown only to people who trust the poster (300 and more).
